{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>There is one who scatters</b> — to the poor." "<b>And yet increases</b> — the money." "<b>And withholds</b> — his money from uprightness, from doing what is upright, in that he does not give to the poor." "<b>Yet tends to poverty</b> — because want will come upon him, whereas the one who scatters only has increase."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:13.051649386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}